      "text": "1. 100 MIL Dau -> 500 Mil Request Per Day -> 5800 RPS\n2. 50 Bytes -> 100 Mil * 50 * 365 -> yearly data -> 1700 TB",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
