      "updated": 1792182761909,
      "created": 1792180355041,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NFR\n1. Load 10000 RPS Reads(peak), 20 RPS Writes\n2. Data 1M products\n3. Latency p99 < 80 ms\n4. Availbility 99.95% (22minutes of error per month)\n5. Consistency Eventual for Reads, and Strong for Writes\nPrice always re-reads the price from source of truth\n\nOut of scope: cart, checkout, reviews, recommendations,\nauth\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NFR\n1. Load 10000 RPS Reads(peak), 20 RPS Writes\n2. Data 1M products\n3. Latency p99 < 80 ms\n4. Availbility 99.95% (22minutes of error per month)\n5. Consistency Eventual for Reads, and Strong for Writes\nPrice always re-reads the price from source of truth\n\nOut of scope: cart, checkout, reviews, recommendations, auth\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
