    {
      "id": "r7ovxxhYIhC5NQXUplh4h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2305.4100167673587,
      "y": 4751.699634788005,
      "width": 886.0720379921977,
      "height": 490,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bG4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 404968559,
      "version": 586,
      "versionNonce": 1512624384,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792222068102,
      "created": 1792182963534,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. GET /v1/products/{id} - returns product card \n2. GET /v1/categories - returns category tree\n3. GET /v1/categories/{id}/products?sort=&limit=&cursor= -\nlists products of a category \n4. GET\n/v1/search?q=&category=&brand=&price_min=&price_max=&in_st\nock=&sort=&limit=&cursor= - it is filtered search\n\nPagination is cursor-based (not offset): same cost on every\npage.\nSeller Api():\n5. POST /v1/products -> 201 Created\n6. PATCH /v1/products/{id} (with version) -> 200 OK\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. GET /v1/products/{id} - returns product card \n2. GET /v1/categories - returns category tree\n3. GET /v1/categories/{id}/products?sort=&limit=&cursor= - lists products of a category \n4. GET /v1/search?q=&category=&brand=&price_min=&price_max=&in_stock=&sort=&limit=&cursor= - it is filtered search\n\nPagination is cursor-based (not offset): same cost on every page.\nSeller Api():\n5. POST /v1/products -> 201 Created\n6. PATCH /v1/products/{id} (with version) -> 200 OK\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
