      "text": "Scaling Type",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scaling Type",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "v5qLf1Wi0BsLcEdePRxZY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2313.1160285612896,
      "y": 6077.2917541725155,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bGJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1257371599,
      "version": 353,
      "versionNonce": 525377280,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792221979877,
      "created": 1792184211682,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Horizontal\n1. Product Service and Search Service are stateless\n2. Reads scale by copies: CDN, Redis, DB read replicas,\nsearch replicas.\n3. The whole catalog is small (6 GB), so every replica\nholds a full copy. No sharding.\n4. DB: one primary is enough for 20 writes per second.\n5. Scale up first. Shard by product_id only if data > ~1\nTB or writes reach thousands per second.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Horizontal\n1. Product Service and Search Service are stateless\n2. Reads scale by copies: CDN, Redis, DB read replicas, search replicas.\n3. The whole catalog is small (6 GB), so every replica holds a full copy. No sharding.\n4. DB: one primary is enough for 20 writes per second.\n5. Scale up first. Shard by product_id only if data > ~1 TB or writes reach thousands per second.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
