      "text": "Caching",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Caching",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ENKzfNvkszgNbrP7LM6cp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2324.6465737974586,
      "y": 7316.042305264258,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 455,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1672535808,
      "version": 453,
      "versionNonce": 537342208,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792222785597,
      "created": 1792222433909,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CDN: images (long TTL, URL changes when image changes)\nand public GET responses (short TTL ~60 s)\n\nRedis (cache-aside), primary + replica with Sentinel:\n- Cards: long TTL (hours + jitter), key deleted on every\nwrite\n- Listings and search: short TTL 30-60 s\n- On cache miss read from DB primary (only ~60 RPS),\nso stale replica data never gets into cache\n- Stampede: only one request rebuilds a hot key (lock),\nothers wait\n- Price at checkout is always read from DB, never from\ncache",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CDN: images (long TTL, URL changes when image changes)\nand public GET responses (short TTL ~60 s)\n\nRedis (cache-aside), primary + replica with Sentinel:\n- Cards: long TTL (hours + jitter), key deleted on every write\n- Listings and search: short TTL 30-60 s\n- On cache miss read from DB primary (only ~60 RPS),\nso stale replica data never gets into cache\n- Stampede: only one request rebuilds a hot key (lock),\nothers wait\n- Price at checkout is always read from DB, never from cache",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
