      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Failure Modes",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Failure Modes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "COQRji1GRbK_ioP-NvD5M",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2332.2363515293678,
      "y": 7899.5042909284475,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 455,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bH6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1194225920,
      "version": 460,
      "versionNonce": 350302464,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792223180390,
      "created": 1792222976236,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Redis down: reads go to DB replicas + ES. Slower but\nworks.\n- DB load grows ~60 -> ~6,000 RPS; gateway rate\nlimiting protects DB.\n\n2. Elasticsearch down: search returns 503, cards and\nlistings work.\n\n3. DB primary down: reads continue (cache, replicas)\n- writes pause until failover to sync replica. No data lost.\n\n4. Service instance down: gateway routes to other copies\n(stateless).",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Redis down: reads go to DB replicas + ES. Slower but works.\n- DB load grows ~60 -> ~6,000 RPS; gateway rate limiting protects DB.\n\n2. Elasticsearch down: search returns 503, cards and listings work.\n\n3. DB primary down: reads continue (cache, replicas)\n- writes pause until failover to sync replica. No data lost.\n\n4. Service instance down: gateway routes to other copies (stateless).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
